{"id":"65efb02e976f40b6","group":"89","path":"89/89-df-gl-derivable.md","title":"GL Derivable","display":"df-gl-derivable — GL Derivable","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"The Logic of Provability","book_abbrev":"89","label":"89-df-gl-derivable","aliases":["89-df-gl-derivable"],"display":"df-gl-derivable — GL Derivable","depends_on":["[[89-df-gl-derivation]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"The Logic of Provability"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"89"},{"key":"label","html":"89-df-gl-derivable"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>89-df-gl-derivable</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-gl-derivable — GL Derivable"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"68e33d1af76a6bfa\" href=\"?note=68e33d1af76a6bfa\" title=\"89-df-gl-derivation\">89-df-gl-derivation</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Der}_{G\\!L}\">\\(\\mathrm{Der}_{G\\!L}\\)</span> is the predicate on\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}^{&lt;\\omega}\\times\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\">\\(\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}^{&lt;\\omega}\\times\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\)</span> from\n<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"68e33d1af76a6bfa\" href=\"?note=68e33d1af76a6bfa\" title=\"89-df-gl-derivation\">89-df-gl-derivation</a>.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}gl\\text{-}derivable}\\vdash\n\\mathcal{D}_{G\\!L}\\coloneqq\n\\{A\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\mid\n\\exists\\pi\\;\\mathrm{Der}_{G\\!L}(\\pi,A)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}gl\\text{-}derivable}\\vdash\n\\mathcal{D}_{G\\!L}\\coloneqq\n\\{A\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\mid\n\\exists\\pi\\;\\mathrm{Der}_{G\\!L}(\\pi,A)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>GL可推导公式在 GL 中有证明</li>\n<li>GL可推导公式是 GL 的定理</li>\n<li>GL可推导性是 GL 的核心概念</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"89-df-gl-derivation","status":"resolved","id":"68e33d1af76a6bfa","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-gl-derivation]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-gl-derivation","status":"resolved","id":"68e33d1af76a6bfa","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Der}_{G\\!L}$ is the predicate on\n$\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}^{<\\omega}\\times\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}$ from\n[[89-df-gl-derivation]].","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{Der}_{G\\!L}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}^{<\\omega}\\times\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}gl\\text{-}derivable}\\vdash\n\\mathcal{D}_{G\\!L}\\coloneqq\n\\{A\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\mid\n\\exists\\pi\\;\\mathrm{Der}_{G\\!L}(\\pi,A)\\}.","display":true}],"bytes":704,"backlinks":[{"id":"c2a8f862c318be2c","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathcal{D}_{G\\!L}\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}$ (see [[89-df-gl-derivable]])."},{"id":"b560939370c68b68","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"e0c421a5b45aeb77","anchor":"ref-40","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"有限证明与闭包：[[89-df-gl-proof-system]] → [[89-df-gl-derivable]] → [[89-lem-gl-proof-closure]] → [[89-df-gl-theorem]]。"}],"outgoing":["68e33d1af76a6bfa"]}